{"seq":2,"slug":"background-sync","title":"后台同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-production-engineering/capabilities/background-sync","wordCount":1178,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"后台同步\">后台同步</h1><p>设想用户在地铁里给一条朋友圈点了赞，然后信号断了，接着锁屏把手机塞回口袋。这个赞该怎么办？如果只在页面里用 <code>fetch</code> 重试，页面一关闭重试就中断，赞就丢了。后台同步（Background Sync）正是为这一刻而生：它让浏览器接管「等网络恢复后重放失败请求」这件事，即使发起请求的页面早已关闭。它是 <a href=\"../service-worker/offline-first\">离线优先架构</a> 中「可靠写入」的最后一公里，把「尽量送达」变成「保证送达」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>后台同步其实是两个相关但不同的 API。<strong>Background Sync API</strong>（一次性后台同步）解决「这个操作要可靠送达一次」的问题：注册一个同步标签，浏览器会在网络恢复时唤醒 Service Worker 触发 <code>sync</code> 事件，让你重放排队的请求。<strong>Periodic Background Sync API</strong>（周期性后台同步）解决「定期在后台拉取新内容」的问题：让应用每隔一段时间被唤醒去更新数据，比如新闻应用在清晨预取头条。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[用户离线时执行写操作] --&gt; B[把请求存入 IndexedDB 队列]&#10;  B --&gt; C[注册 sync 标签&lt;br/&gt;registration.sync.register]&#10;  C --&gt; D{网络是否可用}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[浏览器持续等待&lt;br/&gt;页面可关闭]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[唤醒 Service Worker&lt;br/&gt;触发 sync 事件]&#10;  E -.网络恢复.-&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[读取队列逐条重放]&#10;  G --&gt; H{重放成功?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[从队列移除]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[抛错保留队列&lt;br/&gt;等待下次重试]\">flowchart TD\n  A[用户离线时执行写操作] --&gt; B[把请求存入 IndexedDB 队列]\n  B --&gt; C[注册 sync 标签&lt;br/&gt;registration.sync.register]\n  C --&gt; D{网络是否可用}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[浏览器持续等待&lt;br/&gt;页面可关闭]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[唤醒 Service Worker&lt;br/&gt;触发 sync 事件]\n  E -.网络恢复.-&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[读取队列逐条重放]\n  G --&gt; H{重放成功?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[从队列移除]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[抛错保留队列&lt;br/&gt;等待下次重试]</pre><p>这套机制的可靠性来自一个关键设计：注册的同步标签由浏览器持久保管，与页面生命周期解耦。即使用户关掉了标签页、甚至关掉了浏览器，浏览器仍会在合适时机把 Service Worker 唤醒来完成同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一次性后台同步的实现\">一次性后台同步的实现</h2><p>实现一次性后台同步分两步：在页面里离线失败时入队并注册同步，在 Service Worker 里响应 <code>sync</code> 事件重放。队列通常存在 IndexedDB 里（参见 <a href=\"../service-worker/offline-first\">离线优先架构</a> 对 IndexedDB 的介绍）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 页面侧：操作失败时入队并请求后台同步&#10;async function postComment(comment) {&#10;  try {&#10;    await fetch(&#39;/api/comments&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: JSON.stringify(comment) });&#10;  } catch {&#10;    await saveToOutbox(comment); // 存进 IndexedDB 队列&#10;    const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;&#10;    await reg.sync.register(&#39;sync-comments&#39;); // 注册同步标签&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Service Worker 侧：网络恢复时被唤醒&#10;self.addEventListener(&#39;sync&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.tag === &#39;sync-comments&#39;) {&#10;    event.waitUntil(replayOutbox()); // 重放队列&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;async function replayOutbox() {&#10;  const pending = await readOutbox();&#10;  for (const item of pending) {&#10;    await fetch(&#39;/api/comments&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: JSON.stringify(item) });&#10;    await removeFromOutbox(item.id); // 成功才出队&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 页面侧：操作失败时入队并请求后台同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> postComment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">comment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/comments'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(comment) });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> saveToOutbox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(comment); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 存进 IndexedDB 队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.serviceWorker.ready;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reg.sync.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sync-comments'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注册同步标签</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Service Worker 侧：网络恢复时被唤醒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">self.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sync'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event.tag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sync-comments'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">waitUntil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replayOutbox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重放队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> replayOutbox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pending</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readOutbox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pending) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/comments'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item) });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> removeFromOutbox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item.id); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 成功才出队</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>event.waitUntil(replayOutbox())</code> 在这里有特殊语义：如果传入的 Promise 被 reject（说明重放又失败了），浏览器会认为这次同步未完成，并在之后自动重试——这正是「保证送达」的实现机制。因此 <code>replayOutbox</code> 在失败时应当抛出错误，而不是吞掉异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"周期性后台同步\">周期性后台同步</h2><p>周期性后台同步面向「定期更新」而非「可靠送达单次操作」。它需要更高的信任门槛——浏览器会根据站点的「使用频率」「参与度」等指标来决定是否以及多久唤醒一次，开发者无法精确控制间隔，只能给出一个最小间隔的建议。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 注册周期性同步（需要权限且站点参与度达标）&#10;const status = await navigator.permissions.query({ name: &#39;periodic-background-sync&#39; });&#10;if (status.state === &#39;granted&#39;) {&#10;  const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;&#10;  await reg.periodicSync.register(&#39;refresh-feed&#39;, {&#10;    minInterval: 12 * 60 * 60 * 1000, // 建议最小间隔 12 小时&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Service Worker 侧响应&#10;self.addEventListener(&#39;periodicsync&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.tag === &#39;refresh-feed&#39;) {&#10;    event.waitUntil(prefetchLatestFeed());&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注册周期性同步（需要权限且站点参与度达标）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.permissions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'periodic-background-sync'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (status.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'granted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.serviceWorker.ready;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reg.periodicSync.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refresh-feed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    minInterval: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 建议最小间隔 12 小时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Service Worker 侧响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">self.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'periodicsync'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event.tag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'refresh-feed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">waitUntil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prefetchLatestFeed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>周期性同步特别适合「让用户打开应用时已有最新内容」的场景——清晨预取新闻、定时同步邮件草稿。但它对电量与流量敏感，浏览器的保守唤醒策略意味着它不能用于任何有实时性硬要求的功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"workbox-封装与浏览器支持\">Workbox 封装与浏览器支持</h2><p>手写队列与重放容易在边界情况（部分成功、并发、去重）上出错，Workbox 提供了 <code>workbox-background-sync</code> 把这部分工业化。它内置一个 <code>Queue</code>，自动把失败请求入队、在 <code>sync</code> 事件触发时重放，并对不支持 Background Sync API 的浏览器做兜底——在这些浏览器里，它会在每次 Service Worker 启动时尝试重放队列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { BackgroundSyncPlugin } from &#39;workbox-background-sync&#39;;&#10;import { registerRoute } from &#39;workbox-routing&#39;;&#10;import { NetworkOnly } from &#39;workbox-strategies&#39;;&#10;&#10;const bgSync = new BackgroundSyncPlugin(&#39;comments-queue&#39;, {&#10;  maxRetentionTime: 24 * 60, // 队列最多保留 24 小时（分钟）&#10;});&#10;&#10;registerRoute(({ url }) =&gt; url.pathname === &#39;/api/comments&#39;, new NetworkOnly({ plugins: [bgSync] }), &#39;POST&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { BackgroundSyncPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'workbox-background-sync'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { registerRoute } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'workbox-routing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NetworkOnly } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'workbox-strategies'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bgSync</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BackgroundSyncPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'comments-queue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxRetentionTime: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 队列最多保留 24 小时（分钟）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url.pathname </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/api/comments'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NetworkOnly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ plugins: [bgSync] }), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这与 <a href=\"../service-worker/caching-strategies\">缓存策略</a> 一篇介绍的 Workbox 路由是同一套体系——把后台同步作为一个插件挂到 <code>NetworkOnly</code> 策略上，写操作失败便自动进入可靠重放队列。</p>\n<p>浏览器支持是后台同步绕不开的现实。下表概括 2026 年的态势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>Chrome / Edge</th>\n<th>Firefox</th>\n<th>Safari (含 iOS)</th>\n<th>兜底方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Background Sync</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>Workbox 在 SW 启动时重放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Periodic Background Sync</td>\n<td>支持（需参与度）</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>退化为打开时拉取</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可见后台同步在 Chromium 系最完整，而 Safari 与 Firefox 尚不支持原生 API。因此<strong>绝不能把数据可靠性的唯一保障押在 Background Sync 上</strong>——在不支持的浏览器里，仍需保留「页面打开时主动重放队列」的兜底逻辑（这正是 Workbox 默认提供的），才能保证 <a href=\"../service-worker/offline-first\">离线优先架构</a> 在所有平台都不丢数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>后台同步让浏览器在网络恢复后唤醒 Service Worker 重放失败请求，即使页面已关闭，是离线写入「保证送达」的关键。</li>\n<li>一次性 Background Sync 用 <code>sync.register</code> 注册标签、在 <code>sync</code> 事件重放队列；<code>waitUntil</code> 的 Promise 失败会触发自动重试。</li>\n<li>周期性 Background Sync 面向定期后台更新，间隔由浏览器按站点参与度决定，不适合实时性硬要求的功能。</li>\n<li>Workbox 的 <code>BackgroundSyncPlugin</code> 把队列与重放工业化，并对不支持的浏览器在 SW 启动时兜底重放。</li>\n<li>后台同步目前仅 Chromium 系原生支持，Safari/Firefox 缺失，因此可靠性不能只依赖它，须保留打开时重放的兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"后台同步","id":"后台同步"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一次性后台同步的实现","id":"一次性后台同步的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"周期性后台同步","id":"周期性后台同步"},{"level":2,"text":"Workbox 封装与浏览器支持","id":"workbox-封装与浏览器支持"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推送通知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-production-engineering/capabilities/push-notifications"},"next":{"title":"设备 API 与文件系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-production-engineering/capabilities/device-apis"}}